#: rc.cpp:4
msgid ""
"\n"
"1) The KDE daemon, 'kded' is not running. You can restart it by running the "
"command 'kdeinit' and then try reloading the KDE Control Center to see if "
"this message goes away.\n"
"\n"
"2) You don't appear to have smartcard support in the KDE libraries. You will "
"need to recompile the kdelibs package with libpcsclite installed."
msgstr ""
"\n"
"1)KDE daemon, 'kded' chu+a cha.y . Ba.n co' the^? kho+?i ddo^.ng la.i no'"
"ba(`ng ca'ch cha.y le^.nh kdeinit va` thu+? ta?i la.i Trung Ta^m DDie^`u Khie^?n"
"KDE dde^? xem tho^ng ddie^.p na`y co' ma^'t ddi hay kho^ng . \n"
"\n"
"2) Ba.n co' ve? nhu+ kho^ng co' smartcard ddu+o+.c ho^~ tro+. bo+?i ca'c"
"thu+ vie^.n cu?a KDE . Ba.n co' the^? ca^`n pha?i bie^n di.ch la.i go'i kdelibs"
"co' libpcscte ddu+o+.c ca`i dda(.t cu`ng ."

